WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.627
He's going back to honest work.

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:18.601
Number 214.

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:20.145
Yes?

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:21.813
Having fun?

00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:24.941
It's surprisingly fun once you try it.

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:29.112
I can introduce you to a job
if you'd like.

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:30.613
A job?

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:32.824
You're getting out soon, right?

00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:34.367
Do you have a plan?

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:36.119
I don't.

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:39.497
If you don't want your mom
in heaven to worry,

00:00:39.789 --> 00:00:42.459
you should get your basic needs met.

00:00:44.836 --> 00:00:46.629
I have a message from Laurent.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.716
Preparations for your new party are ready.

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:53.636
Let me know when you plan to start work.

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:58.183
Let's do business abroad again,
Mr. Edamura.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.687
Undergarments. Bag.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:04.564
Smartphone

00:01:07.525 --> 00:01:09.027
Wallet.

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:12.489
Seven items in total.

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:24.751
A little girl with a yellow melon

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:28.379
A little boy with a green watermelon

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:31.091
What is that?

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:32.759
It's called cornering!

00:01:38.056 --> 00:01:40.016
Oh, wow, it's Makoto.

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:41.893
Congratulations on getting out.

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:44.354
I'm sorry for causing you trouble.

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:47.690
Here's two-years'-worth of rent.

00:01:48.191 --> 00:01:49.859
Thanks a bunch.

00:01:50.401 --> 00:01:53.363
Oh, right,
a new toy capsule Gacchan came in.

00:01:53.404 --> 00:01:54.531
Give it a whirl.

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:59.911
SUGIYAMA MARKET

00:02:16.094 --> 00:02:17.095
Laurent.

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:19.722
I thought a lot about this.

00:02:20.431 --> 00:02:23.101
I think I'll leave the party after all.

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.312
During my life in prison,

00:02:26.563 --> 00:02:28.898
my thinking and way of life

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:30.733
changed a lot.

00:02:33.736 --> 00:02:34.737
Excuse me.

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:36.948
Yes?

00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:40.076
If you're selling something,
we don't need it.

00:02:40.451 --> 00:02:44.164
No, I'm Makoto Edamura,
and I'll be in your care starting today.

00:02:44.747 --> 00:02:46.082
Oh, it's you.

00:02:46.749 --> 00:02:48.459
Then get changed in the back.

00:02:49.085 --> 00:02:49.961
Yes, sir!

00:02:50.086 --> 00:02:50.962
NAKANOSHIMA

00:02:51.921 --> 00:02:53.590
No matter who the target is,

00:02:54.424 --> 00:02:56.301
we shouldn't trick others.

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.762
I always wake up at the same time,

00:02:59.846 --> 00:03:01.514
work with sweat on my brows,

00:03:02.473 --> 00:03:03.850
take a bath, and sleep.

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:09.606
I think that kind of life
is what happiness is.

